SUMMARY:INLG 2026 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:International Natural Language Generation Conference\nStatus: c
 onfirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://2026.inlgmeeting.
 org/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#inlg-2026\nNote
 s: Official INLG 2026 pages (reviewed 2026-10-31) confirm Utrecht (Spoorw
 egmuseum\; hosted by Utrecht University)\, Oct 17-21: workshops and tutor
 ials Oct 17-18\, main conference Oct 19-21\, presentations in person only
 . All deadlines are AoE. Direct long/short and demo submissions moved fro
 m July 15 to July 18\; the last ARR submission deadline eligible for comm
 itment was May 25. A new non-archival track took work-in-progress abstrac
 ts (max 300 words) or papers published elsewhere\, with light review. Acc
 epted: 82 long\, 13 short and 5 demo papers (ACL Anthology) plus 27 non-a
 rchival posters. Size is an editorial estimate.
