 olve\; SIGGEN pages list no 2027 edition). INLG has met yearly since at l
 east 2016\, but timing varies from July to December\; 2025-2026 met in la
 te October before EMNLP. Meeting dates are a one-year proxy from INLG 202
 6 (Oct 17-21). The paper and ARR-commitment dates proxy 2026's original J
 uly 15 and Aug 5 dates (2025 and 2026 both extended papers to July 18). T
 he 2026 non-archival track is not projected. Size is an editorial estimat
 e.
